{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1793462367825,"sessionID":"ses_e6d5a7eaaffeH1wroUP5Ck5Yd2","part":{"partID":"prt_192afa843002Z6uxDV0XGBEx9x","sessionID":"ses_e6d5a7eaaffeH1wroUP5Ck5Yd2","messageID":"msg_192afa00f001JhDHqZz3wUZ6FH","type":"tool","id":"call_01a192afa565762dbb80360f687265bf","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"/// Host invite panel (TV settings overlay page, separately labelled HOST QR).\n///\n/// Shows exactly one QR encoding the scoped host invite capability\n/// ([buildHostJoinPayload]: `partyId` + `channelId` + `inviteToken` +\n/// `role: 'host'` — never the TV device identity), the session scope, and\n/// the server-stated expiry. The invite always comes from the host-only\n/// `createHostInvite` response via [HostInviteClient]; nothing is fabricated\n/// from build-time config.\n///\n/// States: loading (no fabricated QR), ready (QR + REFRESH re-mint),\n/// expired (stale capability hidden, refresh offered), denial/error (reason\n/// shown, last valid session retained when one exists), and unavailable\n/// (no [HostInviteClient] — the wall never opens this destination, like the\n/// offline guest-codes path).\n///\n/// Refresh is manual (REFRESH re-mints) plus a 1s expiry ticker that hides\n/// the QR the moment the invite lapses. Overlapping mints are skipped,\n/// timers are cancelled on disposal, and late responses after disposal are\n/// ignored.\nlibrary;\n\nimport 'dart:async';\n\nimport 'package:core_foundation/core_foundation.dart';\nimport 'package:core_ui/core_ui.dart';\nimport 'package:flutter/material.dart';\nimport 'package:flutter/services.dart';\nimport 'package:qr_flutter/qr_flutter.dart';\n\nimport 'package:tv_app/src/wall/host_codes.dart';\n\n/// Key of the host code panel.\nconst Key kHostCodePanelKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-panel');\n\n/// Key of the host-code close button.\nconst Key kHostCodeCloseKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-close');\n\n/// Key of the host-code back button (returns to the recovery actions).\nconst Key kHostCodeBackKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-back');\n\n/// Key of the single invite QR (present only with a live, unexpired invite).\nconst Key kHostCodeQrKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-qr');\n\n/// Key of the session scope/expiry line.\nconst Key kHostCodeSessionKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-session');\n\n/// Key of the manual refresh button.\nconst Key kHostCodeRefreshKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-refresh');\n\n/// Key of the loading indicator text.\nconst Key kHostCodeLoadingKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-loading');\n\n/// Key of the error text.\nconst Key kHostCodeErrorKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-error');\n\n/// Key of the expired-invite text.\nconst Key kHostCodeExpiryKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-expiry');\n\n/// Bounds a single invite mint: without this, a hung callable would hold\n/// `_fetching` true forever and wedge the panel (no retries, stale QR).\nconst Duration kHostInviteFetchTimeout = Duration(seconds: 10);\n\n/// Host panel: scoped invite QR + expiry + manual refresh.\n///\n/// Owns its mint: fetches immediately on open and re-evaluates expiry on a\n/// 1s ticker while mounted. Pass a fake [HostInviteClient.invoker] in widget\n/// tests; production passes the real Cloud Functions client.\nclass HostCodePanel extends StatefulWidget {\n  /// Creates the host code panel.\n  const HostCodePanel({\n    super.key,\n    required this.client,\n    required this.onClose,\n    this.onBack,\n    this.primaryFocusNode,\n    this.clock = const SystemClock(),\n  });\n\n  /// Host-only invite minter (authorization carries the TV's device id).\n  final HostInviteClient client;\n\n  /// Closes the whole overlay.\n  final VoidCallback onClose;\n\n  /// Returns to the recovery actions; null hides the back button.\n  final VoidCallback? onBack;\n\n  /// Focus node for the first action, so the D-pad lands inside the panel.\n  final FocusNode? primaryFocusNode;\n\n  /// Clock for expiry evaluation (injectable for deterministic tests).\n  final Clock clock;\n\n  @override\n  State<HostCodePanel> createState() => _HostCodePanelState();\n}\n\nclass _HostCodePanelState extends State<HostCodePanel> {\n  HostInvite? _invite;\n  String? _error;\n  bool _firstFetchDone = false;\n  bool _fetching = false;\n  int _generation = 0;\n  Timer? _expiryTimer;\n\n  @override\n  void initState() {\n    super.initState();\n    unawaited(_refresh());\n    // Re-evaluates expiry only; never re-mints on its own (invites are\n    // server-minted capabilities, not pollable state).\n    _expiryTimer = Timer.periodic(const Duration(seconds: 1), (_) {\n      if (!mounted) {\n        return;\n      }\n      final HostInvite? invite = _invite;\n      if (invite != null && invite.isExpired(widget.clock.now())) {\n        setState(() {});\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  @override\n  void dispose() {\n    _generation++;\n    _expiryTimer?.cancel();\n    _expiryTimer = null;\n    super.dispose();\n  }\n\n  bool get _expired {\n    final HostInvite? invite = _invite;\n    return invite != null && invite.isExpired(widget.clock.now());\n  }\n\n  Future<void> _refresh() async {\n    if (_fetching || !mounted) {\n      return;\n    }\n    _fetching = true;\n    final int generation = _generation;\n    try {\n      final HostInvite invite = await widget.client\n          .createInvite()\n          .timeout(kHostInviteFetchTimeout);\n      if (!mounted || generation != _generation) {\n        return;\n      }\n      setState(() {\n        _invite = invite;\n        _error = null;\n        _firstFetchDone = true;\n      });\n    } on TimeoutException {\n      // A hung mint releases the in-flight guard so the next REFRESH\n      // retries; the last valid invite (if any) is retained behind an\n      // inline error.\n      if (!mounted || generation != _generation) {\n        return;\n      }\n      setState(() {\n        _error = 'host invite refresh timed out';\n        _firstFetchDone = true;\n      });\n    } on Object catch (error) {\n      if (!mounted || generation != _generation) {\n        return;\n      }\n      setState(() {\n        _error = error is HostInviteException\n            ? error.message\n            : 'unexpected host invite failure';\n        _firstFetchDone = true;\n      });\n    } finally {\n      _fetching = false;\n    }\n  }\n\n  KeyEventResult _onKey(FocusNode node, KeyEvent event) {\n    if (event is KeyDownEvent) {\n      if (event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.contextMenu) {\n        widget.onClose();\n        return KeyEventResult.handled;\n      }\n      if (event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.goBack ||\n          event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.escape) {\n        (widget.onBack ?? widget.onClose)();\n        return KeyEventResult.handled;\n      }\n    }\n    return KeyEventResult.ignored;\n  }\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return Focus(\n      canRequestFocus: false,\n      skipTraversal: true,\n      onKeyEvent: _onKey,\n      child: ColoredBox(\n        color: const Color(0xE6000000),\n        child: Center(\n          child: ConstrainedBox(\n            constraints: const BoxConstraints(maxWidth: 720),\n            child: Container(\n              key: kHostCodePanelKey,\n              padding: const EdgeInsets.all(28),\n              decoration: BoxDecoration(\n                color: const Color(0xFF101410),\n                border: Border.all(color: CctvTheme.frameEdge, width: 2),\n              ),\n              child: SingleChildScrollView(\n                child: Column(\n                  mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,\n                  crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\n                  children: <Widget>[\n                    const Text('HOST QR', style: CctvTheme.labelStyle),\n                    const SizedBox(height: 8),\n                    const Text(\n                      'On the companion app, open the host entry and scan '\n                      'this code. Guests use GUEST CODES instead — the guest '\n                      'PIN can never grant host access.',\n                      style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 18),\n                    ),\n                    const SizedBox(height: 20),\n                    Row(\n                      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\n                      children: <Widget>[\n                        Expanded(\n                          child: Column(\n                            crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\n                            children: <Widget>[\n                              const Text(\n                                'HOST INVITE',\n                                style: TextStyle(\n                                  color: Color(0xFFFFC107),\n                                  fontSize: 20,\n                                ),\n                              ),\n                              const SizedBox(height: 4),\n                              _sessionLine(),\n                            ],\n                          ),\n                        ),\n                        _qrBox(),\n                      ],\n                    ),\n                    const SizedBox(height: 8),\n                    _stateLine(),\n                    const SizedBox(height: 20),\n                    FocusTraversalGroup(\n                      child: Column(\n                        mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,\n                        crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.stretch,\n                        children: <Widget>[\n                          if (widget.onBack != null)\n                            _PanelButton(\n                              actionKey: kHostCodeBackKey,\n                              label: 'BACK',\n                              focusNode: widget.primaryFocusNode,\n                              onPressed: widget.onBack!,\n                            ),\n                          if (widget.onBack != null)\n                            const SizedBox(height: 10),\n                          _PanelButton(\n                            actionKey: kHostCodeRefreshKey,\n                            label: 'REFRESH',\n                            focusNode: widget.onBack == null\n                                ? widget.primaryFocusNode\n                                : null,\n                            onPressed: () => unawaited(_refresh()),\n                          ),\n                          const SizedBox(height: 10),\n                          _PanelButton(\n                            actionKey: kHostCodeCloseKey,\n                            label: 'CLOSE',\n                            onPressed: widget.onClose,\n                          ),\n                        ],\n                      ),\n                    ),\n                  ],\n                ),\n              ),\n            ),\n          ),\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n\n  Widget _sessionLine() {\n    final HostInvite? invite = _invite;\n    if (invite == null) {\n      return Text(\n        'party ${widget.client.partyId} · ${widget.client.channelId}',\n        key: kHostCodeSessionKey,\n        style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 18),\n      );\n    }\n    return Text(\n      'party ${invite.partyId} · ${invite.channelId} · '\n      'expires ${invite.expiresAt.toUtc().toIso8601String()}',\n      key: kHostCodeSessionKey,\n      style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 18),\n    );\n  }\n\n  /// Exactly one QR while a live, unexpired invite exists; no fabricated\n  /// QR before the first successful mint, and the stale capability is\n  /// hidden the moment it lapses.\n  Widget _qrBox() {\n    final HostInvite? invite = _invite;\n    if (invite == null || _expired) {\n      return Container(\n        width: 204,\n        height: 204,\n        alignment: Alignment.center,\n        decoration: BoxDecoration(\n          border: Border.all(color: CctvTheme.frameEdge),\n        ),\n        child: Text(\n          _expired ? 'Invite expired — refresh.' : 'Waiting for invite…',\n          textAlign: TextAlign.center,\n          style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 16),\n        ),\n      );\n    }\n    final String payload = buildHostJoinPayload(\n      partyId: invite.partyId,\n      channelId: invite.channelId,\n      inviteToken: invite.inviteToken,\n    );\n    return Container(\n      padding: const EdgeInsets.all(12),\n      color: Colors.white,\n      child: QrImageView(\n        key: kHostCodeQrKey,\n        data: payload,\n        semanticsLabel: payload,\n        size: 180,\n        backgroundColor: Colors.white,\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n\n  Widget _stateLine() {\n    if (!_firstFetchDone && _invite == null && _error == null) {\n      return const Text(\n        'Minting host invite…',\n        key: kHostCodeLoadingKey,\n        style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 22),\n      );\n    }\n    // First mint failed with nothing valid to show: error, no QR.\n    if (_invite == null && _error != null) {\n      return Text(\n        'Host invite unavailable: $_error',\n        key: kHostCodeErrorKey,\n        style: const TextStyle(color: Color(0xFFFFC107), fontSize: 22),\n      );\n    }\n    if (_expired) {\n      return Column(\n        crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\n        mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,\n        children: <Widget>[\n          const Text(\n            'Invite expired — refresh for a new code.',\n            key: kHostCodeExpiryKey,\n            style: TextStyle(color: Color(0xFFFFC107), fontSize: 22),\n          ),\n          if (_error != null)\n            Padding(\n              padding: const EdgeInsets.only(top: 8),\n              child: Text(\n                'Refresh failed: $_error — showing last invite.',\n                key: kHostCodeErrorKey,\n                style: const TextStyle(\n                  color: Color(0xFFFFC107),\n                  fontSize: 18,\n                ),\n              ),\n            ),\n        ],\n      );\n    }\n    if (_error != null) {\n      return Text(\n        'Refresh failed: $_error — showing last invite.',\n        key: kHostCodeErrorKey,\n        style: const TextStyle(color: Color(0xFFFFC107), fontSize: 18),\n      );\n    }\n    return const SizedBox.shrink();\n  }\n}\n\n/// Large, TV-focusable panel action.\nclass _PanelButton extends StatelessWidget {\n  const _PanelButton({\n    required this.actionKey,\n    required this.label,\n    required this.onPressed,\n    this.focusNode,\n  });\n\n  final Key actionKey;\n  final String label;\n  final VoidCallback onPressed;\n  final FocusNode? focusNode;\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return OutlinedButton(\n      key: actionKey,\n      focusNode: focusNode,\n      onPressed: onPressed,\n      style: OutlinedButton.styleFrom(\n        foregroundColor: Colors.white,\n        side: const BorderSide(color: CctvTheme.frameEdge, width: 2),\n        padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 20, vertical: 16),\n        textStyle: CctvTheme.badgeStyle,\n      ),\n      child: Align(alignment: Alignment.centerLeft, child: Text(label)),\n    );\n  }\n}\n","path":"/private/tmp/orchestrator/cycle-12/part-2/apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/host_code_panel.dart"},"output":"Created file successfully: apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/host_code_panel.dart","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/host_code_panel.dart"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false,"state":{"itemId":"fc_01a192afa565762dbb80360f687265bf"}},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"/// Host invite panel (TV settings overlay page, separately labelled HOST QR).\\n///\\n/// Shows exactly one QR encoding the scoped host invite capability\\n/// ([buildHostJoinPayload]: `partyId` + `channelId` + `inviteToken` +\\n/// `role: 'host'` — never the TV device identity), the session scope, and\\n/// the server-stated expiry. The invite always comes from the host-only\\n/// `createHostInvite` response via [HostInviteClient]; nothing is fabricated\\n/// from build-time config.\\n///\\n/// States: loading (no fabricated QR), ready (QR + REFRESH re-mint),\\n/// expired (stale capability hidden, refresh offered), denial/error (reason\\n/// shown, last valid session retained when one exists), and unavailable\\n/// (no [HostInviteClient] — the wall never opens this destination, like the\\n/// offline guest-codes path).\\n///\\n/// Refresh is manual (REFRESH re-mints) plus a 1s expiry ticker that hides\\n/// the QR the moment the invite lapses. Overlapping mints are skipped,\\n/// timers are cancelled on disposal, and late responses after disposal are\\n/// ignored.\\nlibrary;\\n\\nimport 'dart:async';\\n\\nimport 'package:core_foundation/core_foundation.dart';\\nimport 'package:core_ui/core_ui.dart';\\nimport 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\nimport 'package:flutter/services.dart';\\nimport 'package:qr_flutter/qr_flutter.dart';\\n\\nimport 'package:tv_app/src/wall/host_codes.dart';\\n\\n/// Key of the host code panel.\\nconst Key kHostCodePanelKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-panel');\\n\\n/// Key of the host-code close button.\\nconst Key kHostCodeCloseKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-close');\\n\\n/// Key of the host-code back button (returns to the recovery actions).\\nconst Key kHostCodeBackKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-back');\\n\\n/// Key of the single invite QR (present only with a live, unexpired invite).\\nconst Key kHostCodeQrKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-qr');\\n\\n/// Key of the session scope/expiry line.\\nconst Key kHostCodeSessionKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-session');\\n\\n/// Key of the manual refresh button.\\nconst Key kHostCodeRefreshKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-refresh');\\n\\n/// Key of the loading indicator text.\\nconst Key kHostCodeLoadingKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-loading');\\n\\n/// Key of the error text.\\nconst Key kHostCodeErrorKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-error');\\n\\n/// Key of the expired-invite text.\\nconst Key kHostCodeExpiryKey = ValueKey<String>('host-code-expiry');\\n\\n/// Bounds a single invite mint: without this, a hung callable would hold\\n/// `_fetching` true forever and wedge the panel (no retries, stale QR).\\nconst Duration kHostInviteFetchTimeout = Duration(seconds: 10);\\n\\n/// Host panel: scoped invite QR + expiry + manual refresh.\\n///\\n/// Owns its mint: fetches immediately on open and re-evaluates expiry on a\\n/// 1s ticker while mounted. Pass a fake [HostInviteClient.invoker] in widget\\n/// tests; production passes the real Cloud Functions client.\\nclass HostCodePanel extends StatefulWidget {\\n  /// Creates the host code panel.\\n  const HostCodePanel({\\n    super.key,\\n    required this.client,\\n    required this.onClose,\\n    this.onBack,\\n    this.primaryFocusNode,\\n    this.clock = const SystemClock(),\\n  });\\n\\n  /// Host-only invite minter (authorization carries the TV's device id).\\n  final HostInviteClient client;\\n\\n  /// Closes the whole overlay.\\n  final VoidCallback onClose;\\n\\n  /// Returns to the recovery actions; null hides the back button.\\n  final VoidCallback? onBack;\\n\\n  /// Focus node for the first action, so the D-pad lands inside the panel.\\n  final FocusNode? primaryFocusNode;\\n\\n  /// Clock for expiry evaluation (injectable for deterministic tests).\\n  final Clock clock;\\n\\n  @override\\n  State<HostCodePanel> createState() => _HostCodePanelState();\\n}\\n\\nclass _HostCodePanelState extends State<HostCodePanel> {\\n  HostInvite? _invite;\\n  String? _error;\\n  bool _firstFetchDone = false;\\n  bool _fetching = false;\\n  int _generation = 0;\\n  Timer? _expiryTimer;\\n\\n  @override\\n  void initState() {\\n    super.initState();\\n    unawaited(_refresh());\\n    // Re-evaluates expiry only; never re-mints on its own (invites are\\n    // server-minted capabilities, not pollable state).\\n    _expiryTimer = Timer.periodic(const Duration(seconds: 1), (_) {\\n      if (!mounted) {\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      final HostInvite? invite = _invite;\\n      if (invite != null && invite.isExpired(widget.clock.now())) {\\n        setState(() {});\\n      }\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  @override\\n  void dispose() {\\n    _generation++;\\n    _expiryTimer?.cancel();\\n    _expiryTimer = null;\\n    super.dispose();\\n  }\\n\\n  bool get _expired {\\n    final HostInvite? invite = _invite;\\n    return invite != null && invite.isExpired(widget.clock.now());\\n  }\\n\\n  Future<void> _refresh() async {\\n    if (_fetching || !mounted) {\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    _fetching = true;\\n    final int generation = _generation;\\n    try {\\n      final HostInvite invite = await widget.client\\n          .createInvite()\\n          .timeout(kHostInviteFetchTimeout);\\n      if (!mounted || generation != _generation) {\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      setState(() {\\n        _invite = invite;\\n        _error = null;\\n        _firstFetchDone = true;\\n      });\\n    } on TimeoutException {\\n      // A hung mint releases the in-flight guard so the next REFRESH\\n      // retries; the last valid invite (if any) is retained behind an\\n      // inline error.\\n      if (!mounted || generation != _generation) {\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      setState(() {\\n        _error = 'host invite refresh timed out';\\n        _firstFetchDone = true;\\n      });\\n    } on Object catch (error) {\\n      if (!mounted || generation != _generation) {\\n        return;\\n      }\\n      setState(() {\\n        _error = error is HostInviteException\\n            ? error.message\\n            : 'unexpected host invite failure';\\n        _firstFetchDone = true;\\n      });\\n    } finally {\\n      _fetching = false;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  KeyEventResult _onKey(FocusNode node, KeyEvent event) {\\n    if (event is KeyDownEvent) {\\n      if (event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.contextMenu) {\\n        widget.onClose();\\n        return KeyEventResult.handled;\\n      }\\n      if (event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.goBack ||\\n          event.logicalKey == LogicalKeyboardKey.escape) {\\n        (widget.onBack ?? widget.onClose)();\\n        return KeyEventResult.handled;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return KeyEventResult.ignored;\\n  }\\n\\n  @override\\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\\n    return Focus(\\n      canRequestFocus: false,\\n      skipTraversal: true,\\n      onKeyEvent: _onKey,\\n      child: ColoredBox(\\n        color: const Color(0xE6000000),\\n        child: Center(\\n          child: ConstrainedBox(\\n            constraints: const BoxConstraints(maxWidth: 720),\\n            child: Container(\\n              key: kHostCodePanelKey,\\n              padding: const EdgeInsets.all(28),\\n              decoration: BoxDecoration(\\n                color: const Color(0xFF101410),\\n                border: Border.all(color: CctvTheme.frameEdge, width: 2),\\n              ),\\n              child: SingleChildScrollView(\\n                child: Column(\\n                  mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,\\n                  crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\\n                  children: <Widget>[\\n                    const Text('HOST QR', style: CctvTheme.labelStyle),\\n                    const SizedBox(height: 8),\\n                    const Text(\\n                      'On the companion app, open the host entry and scan '\\n                      'this code. Guests use GUEST CODES instead — the guest '\\n                      'PIN can never grant host access.',\\n                      style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 18),\\n                    ),\\n                    const SizedBox(height: 20),\\n                    Row(\\n                      crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\\n                      children: <Widget>[\\n                        Expanded(\\n                          child: Column(\\n                            crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\\n                            children: <Widget>[\\n                              const Text(\\n                                'HOST INVITE',\\n                                style: TextStyle(\\n                                  color: Color(0xFFFFC107),\\n                                  fontSize: 20,\\n                                ),\\n                              ),\\n                              const SizedBox(height: 4),\\n                              _sessionLine(),\\n                            ],\\n                          ),\\n                        ),\\n                        _qrBox(),\\n                      ],\\n                    ),\\n                    const SizedBox(height: 8),\\n                    _stateLine(),\\n                    const SizedBox(height: 20),\\n                    FocusTraversalGroup(\\n                      child: Column(\\n                        mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,\\n                        crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.stretch,\\n                        children: <Widget>[\\n                          if (widget.onBack != null)\\n                            _PanelButton(\\n                              actionKey: kHostCodeBackKey,\\n                              label: 'BACK',\\n                              focusNode: widget.primaryFocusNode,\\n                              onPressed: widget.onBack!,\\n                            ),\\n                          if (widget.onBack != null)\\n                            const SizedBox(height: 10),\\n                          _PanelButton(\\n                            actionKey: kHostCodeRefreshKey,\\n                            label: 'REFRESH',\\n                            focusNode: widget.onBack == null\\n                                ? widget.primaryFocusNode\\n                                : null,\\n                            onPressed: () => unawaited(_refresh()),\\n                          ),\\n                          const SizedBox(height: 10),\\n                          _PanelButton(\\n                            actionKey: kHostCodeCloseKey,\\n                            label: 'CLOSE',\\n                            onPressed: widget.onClose,\\n                          ),\\n                        ],\\n                      ),\\n                    ),\\n                  ],\\n                ),\\n              ),\\n            ),\\n          ),\\n        ),\\n      ),\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  Widget _sessionLine() {\\n    final HostInvite? invite = _invite;\\n    if (invite == null) {\\n      return Text(\\n        'party ${widget.client.partyId} · ${widget.client.channelId}',\\n        key: kHostCodeSessionKey,\\n        style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 18),\\n      );\\n    }\\n    return Text(\\n      'party ${invite.partyId} · ${invite.channelId} · '\\n      'expires ${invite.expiresAt.toUtc().toIso8601String()}',\\n      key: kHostCodeSessionKey,\\n      style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 18),\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  /// Exactly one QR while a live, unexpired invite exists; no fabricated\\n  /// QR before the first successful mint, and the stale capability is\\n  /// hidden the moment it lapses.\\n  Widget _qrBox() {\\n    final HostInvite? invite = _invite;\\n    if (invite == null || _expired) {\\n      return Container(\\n        width: 204,\\n        height: 204,\\n        alignment: Alignment.center,\\n        decoration: BoxDecoration(\\n          border: Border.all(color: CctvTheme.frameEdge),\\n        ),\\n        child: Text(\\n          _expired ? 'Invite expired — refresh.' : 'Waiting for invite…',\\n          textAlign: TextAlign.center,\\n          style: const TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 16),\\n        ),\\n      );\\n    }\\n    final String payload = buildHostJoinPayload(\\n      partyId: invite.partyId,\\n      channelId: invite.channelId,\\n      inviteToken: invite.inviteToken,\\n    );\\n    return Container(\\n      padding: const EdgeInsets.all(12),\\n      color: Colors.white,\\n      child: QrImageView(\\n        key: kHostCodeQrKey,\\n        data: payload,\\n        semanticsLabel: payload,\\n        size: 180,\\n        backgroundColor: Colors.white,\\n      ),\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  Widget _stateLine() {\\n    if (!_firstFetchDone && _invite == null && _error == null) {\\n      return const Text(\\n        'Minting host invite…',\\n        key: kHostCodeLoadingKey,\\n        style: TextStyle(color: Colors.white70, fontSize: 22),\\n      );\\n    }\\n    // First mint failed with nothing valid to show: error, no QR.\\n    if (_invite == null && _error != null) {\\n      return Text(\\n        'Host invite unavailable: $_error',\\n        key: kHostCodeErrorKey,\\n        style: const TextStyle(color: Color(0xFFFFC107), fontSize: 22),\\n      );\\n    }\\n    if (_expired) {\\n      return Column(\\n        crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,\\n        mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,\\n        children: <Widget>[\\n          const Text(\\n            'Invite expired — refresh for a new code.',\\n            key: kHostCodeExpiryKey,\\n            style: TextStyle(color: Color(0xFFFFC107), fontSize: 22),\\n          ),\\n          if (_error != null)\\n            Padding(\\n              padding: const EdgeInsets.only(top: 8),\\n              child: Text(\\n                'Refresh failed: $_error — showing last invite.',\\n                key: kHostCodeErrorKey,\\n                style: const TextStyle(\\n                  color: Color(0xFFFFC107),\\n                  fontSize: 18,\\n                ),\\n              ),\\n            ),\\n        ],\\n      );\\n    }\\n    if (_error != null) {\\n      return Text(\\n        'Refresh failed: $_error — showing last invite.',\\n        key: kHostCodeErrorKey,\\n        style: const TextStyle(color: Color(0xFFFFC107), fontSize: 18),\\n      );\\n    }\\n    return const SizedBox.shrink();\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/// Large, TV-focusable panel action.\\nclass _PanelButton extends StatelessWidget {\\n  const _PanelButton({\\n    required this.actionKey,\\n    required this.label,\\n    required this.onPressed,\\n    this.focusNode,\\n  });\\n\\n  final Key actionKey;\\n  final String label;\\n  final VoidCallback onPressed;\\n  final FocusNode? focusNode;\\n\\n  @override\\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\\n    return OutlinedButton(\\n      key: actionKey,\\n      focusNode: focusNode,\\n      onPressed: onPressed,\\n      style: OutlinedButton.styleFrom(\\n        foregroundColor: Colors.white,\\n        side: const BorderSide(color: CctvTheme.frameEdge, width: 2),\\n        padding: const EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 20, vertical: 16),\\n        textStyle: CctvTheme.badgeStyle,\\n      ),\\n      child: Align(alignment: Alignment.centerLeft, child: Text(label)),\\n    );\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"path\":\"/private/tmp/orchestrator/cycle-12/part-2/apps/tv_app/lib/src/wall/host_code_panel.dart\"}"},"time":{"start":1793462347843,"end":1793462367825}}}}
